// Campaigns is the durable index for Nomi's campaign workflow. Campaigns
// are one-prompt drafts backed by a real Campaign table (see
// prisma/schema.prisma) and generated by the same Claude engine as every
// other Nomi email (app/email-engine). The picker UI below searches the
// merchant's real Shopify catalogue — no dummy products, no placeholder
// photos.
